# Security headers for every page (Cloudflare Pages). A Content-Security-Policy is NOT set yet: Privy, WalletConnect and the wallet
# RPCs need a long allowlist, so it has to be tried in Report-Only mode first (see docs/audit-mainnet-2026-10-29.md).
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), payment=()
